==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*12 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*12 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2.67~5.33 seconds<sup>80f~160f</sup>.
*12 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

